# Naming Conventions

## Folders & Files

| Artifact | Pattern | Example |
|----------|---------|---------|
| Entity folder | camelCase, Portuguese Bling name | `src/entities/pedidosVendas/` |
| Entity entry | `index.ts` | `src/entities/contatos/index.ts` |
| Operation interface | `<operation>.interface.ts` | `find.interface.ts`, `delete-many.interface.ts` |
| Domain type | `<name>.type.ts` | `situacao.type.ts`, `criterio.type.ts` |
| Test spec | `index.spec.ts` | `src/entities/produtos/__tests__/index.spec.ts` |
| Test fixture | `<operation>-response.ts` | `find-response.ts`, `create-response.ts` |

## TypeScript Identifiers

| Kind | Convention | Example |
|------|------------|---------|
| Entity class | PascalCase, resource name | `Contatos`, `Nfes`, `Homologacao` |
| Interface | `I` prefix + PascalCase | `IFindParams`, `ICreateResponse` |
| Type alias | `I` prefix for domain unions | `ISituacao`, `ICriterio` |
| Interface file exports | Split Params / Body / Response | `src/entities/contatos/interfaces/change-situation.interface.ts` |
| Bling query params | camelCase matching API | `idContato`, `dataInclusaoInicial` |
| Endpoints | kebab-case path strings | `'campos-customizados'`, `'contas/receber'` |

## Method Names

English verbs describing the action, aligned with Bling docs:

- `get` — collection listing
- `find` — single resource by id
- `create`, `update`, `delete`
- `changeSituation`, `deleteMany`, `postStock`, `send`, `download`, etc.

## ESLint Note

`camelcase` is **disabled** for `src/entities/**` (`.eslintrc.json`) so Bling field names and header keys in nested `interfaces/` files are not rewritten.

## Facade Getters

camelCase property names on `BlingBase` matching entity purpose (`bling.formasDePagamento`, `bling.naturezasDeOperacoes`). OAuth-only: `bling.auth`.
